    "title": "Bruce Campbell films and premieres ‚ÄòErnie and Emma‚Äô in Southern Oregon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Green ,\n11 hours ago Actor Bruce Campbell will premiere his latest feature film, “Ernie and Emma,” on Valentine’s Day in Medford. The screening at the Holly Theatre has already sold out. Campbell and producer Ida Gearon filmed the project in Southern Oregon, where they live, choosing to debut it locally rather than in Los Angeles. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
